{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:55:58+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T16:55:58+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"KONE Oyj","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Finland","city":"Espoo","website":"https://www.kone.com","employees":65299,"summary":"KONE Oyj, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the elevator and escalator business worldwide. The company provides elevators, escalators, automatic building doors, and integrated access control solutions, as well as maintenance and modernization solutions. It also offers KONE Office Flow, a modular connected people flow solution that delivers personalized access and enhanced user experiences in workplaces; health and well-being solutions for elevators, escalators, and doors; KONE Access, an access control system, which is integrated with elevator system and building doors; KONE Destination, a destination control system that reduce waiting and travel times; KONE infotainment, a communication channel for building tenants and visitors; and monitoring solutions that enable real-time inspection of elevators and escalators. In addition, the company provides people flow planning and consulting services; solutions for special buildings and large projects; cybersecurity solutions; and energy solutions for greener buildings. It also offers hands-on, immersive training to technicians, engineers, and service professional through a training center in Egypt. KONE Oyj was founded in 1908 and is based in Espoo, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"KONE Oyj, avec ses filiales, exerce ses activités dans les ascenseurs et les escaliers mécaniques dans le monde entier. La société fournit des ascenseurs, des escaliers mécaniques, des portes automatiques de bâtiment et des solutions intégrées de contrôle d'accès, ainsi que des solutions d'entretien et de modernisation. Il offre également KONE Office Flow, une solution modulaire de flux de personnes connectées qui offre un accès personnalisé et une expérience utilisateur améliorée sur les lieux de travail; solutions de santé et de bien-être pour les ascenseurs, les escaliers mécaniques et les portes; KONE Access, un système de contrôle d'accès intégré au système d'ascenseur et aux portes des bâtiments; KONE Destination, un système de contrôle de destination qui réduit les temps d'attente et de déplacement; KONE infotainment, un canal de communication pour les locataires et les visiteurs."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":29977526272,"shares_outstanding":442074920,"trailing_pe":30.442106,"forward_pe":23.333025,"price_to_book":10.853819,"ev_to_ebitda":18.902,"ev_to_revenue":2.533,"dividend_yield":0.0313,"payout_ratio":0.9474,"beta_yahoo":0.788},"targets":{"current_price":57.84,"mean":60.02857,"median":60.0,"high":82.0,"low":46.0,"n_analysts":21,"reco_mean":2.33333,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2027-01-29"],"eps_avg":0.68062,"eps_low":0.66,"eps_high":0.70312,"revenue_avg":3215086020,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.27951,"institutions_pct":0.41421002,"institutions_float_pct":0.57491,"institutions_n":474,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0008,"shares":349195,"value":20197438,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":75.3101}],"funds":[{"name":"MFS Series Trust XVII-MFS International Equity Fund","pct":0.0138,"shares":6241632,"value":361015995,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.026300002},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.010199999,"shares":4604503,"value":266324454,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0087},{"name":"Income Fund of America","pct":0.01,"shares":4520065,"value":261440560,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0068,"shares":3080760,"value":178191158,"date":"2026-06